    "label": "Honors Program",
    "notes": "The proposal, research, data collection, analysis, and writing of the thesis (or the creative equivalent to this process) take place in Chicana/o and Central American Studies 198A, 198B, and 198C, which may not be applied toward the major requirements. An honors thesis of at least 30 pages or a significant creative project is required.",
